<title>DENMARK: Danish October new car yr/yr sales rose 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish October new car yr/yr sales rose 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 14.5 percent in October to 12,073 from 10,544 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     Oct 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>    New car registrations	12,073    10,544</p>
<p>Leading October registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG		  1,542</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp	  1,363</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co		  1,243</p>
<p>    Toyota			   1,047</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman,Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
